# Toadstool Admirer, "ward {2}": the positive control. Bot2's Black Lotus makes three red, so after the Bolt it can pay {2}, the ward
# trigger's counter is paid off and the Bolt deals 3 damage to the Admirer (1/1), which dies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Toadstool Admirer
Forest x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Toadstool Admirer.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Toadstool Admirer)
Bot2.PayCost
? Bot2.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

